- `Tlv::Get` reads 2 bytes (type=0x.., length=15)
- `sizeof(aTlv) + aTlv.GetLength()` = 2 + 15 = 17
- `aMaxLength` = 10 (sizeof(ActiveTimestampTlv))
- Since 10 > 17 is false, aMaxLength stays 10
